{"id": "sllama0141", "pool": "sllama", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2870861199, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "f40edaa94b82cc480a8162abcd570effa331c0a9b7ca31632511f1cd5b9e06ff", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "Who is the tennis player to achieve a Grand Slam in a single season?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/sllama0141.wav", "input_sha256": "f1cbe69151c24a1aa7f5d94aa43f030f24abf0cce5a095b3222156a2a8454336", "input_samples": 70732, "input_s": 4.421, "n_real_chunks": 5, "score": 0.8167, "act": 1.0, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The tennis players who have achieved a calendar-year Grand Slam — winning all four major tournaments in a single season — include: Don Budge — 1938 , Maureen Connolly — 1953 , Rod Laver — 1962 and 1969 , Margaret Court — 1970 , Steffi Graf — 1988 If your question expects one famous answer, it is often Steffi Graf, who achieved the Grand Slam in 1988 and also won Olympic gold that year, making it a Golden Slam.", "expert_answer": "The tennis players who have achieved a **calendar-year Grand Slam** — winning all four major tournaments in a single season — include:\n\n- **Don Budge** — 1938  \n- **Maureen Connolly** — 1953  \n- **Rod Laver** — 1962 and 1969  \n- **Margaret Court** — 1970  \n- **Steffi Graf** — 1988  \n\nIf your question expects one famous answer, it is often **Steffi Graf**, who achieved the Grand Slam in 1988 and also won Olympic gold that year, making it a **Golden Slam**.", "transcript": "Who is the tennis player to achieve a Grand Slam in a single season?\n", "asr_s": 0.93, "expert_s": 4.29, "expert_input_samples": 70732, "expert_input_s": 4.421, "expert_input_sha256": "f1cbe69151c24a1aa7f5d94aa43f030f24abf0cce5a095b3222156a2a8454336", "exper